  "notes": "Surfnerd overview: Secrets/Toes is a reef setup near Kawaiku'i Beach Park, breaking over dead coral. It's really two peaks on the same stretch: Secrets serves up long rights and good shortboard lefts, while Toes is a more relaxed longboard peak. The break sits on a line of offshore reef that also holds Pillars, Boneyards and Wailupes, all of them long paddle-outs. Skill (surfnerd): Intermediate. Access (surfnerd): There's a car park with free parking, plus roadside and restricted parking in the area. surfnerd pin 0.0 km from ours."
