  "notes": "Surfnerd overview: Ma'ili spreads across the 40-acre Ma'ili Beach Park, where a couple of fun reef waves break at either end. At the north end, beside the jetty at the mouth of Ma'ili'ili Stream, sits Green Lanterns, a right-hander. Down at the south end you'll find Tumbleland, a left-breaking reef that carries more power and throws faster, more technical lines over a shallower, sharper bottom. Between the two, the park gives you a broad playing field with both rights and lefts to choose from. Skill (surfnerd): Beginner, Intermediate, Expert. Access (surfnerd): Getting in is easy, straight from Ma'ili Beach Park. surfnerd pin 0.0 km from ours."
